<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila awards five-year licence to new airline.</title>
<headline>Manila awards five-year licence to new airline.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Civil Aeronautics Board (CAB) said on Wednesday it had issued a five-year operating permit to Air Philippines Corp.</p>
<p>Air Philippines is owned by William Gatchalian who is the majority owner of Forum Pacific Inc.</p>
<p>The airline is currently negotiating with foreign groups for a possible equity infusion to support its aircraft acquisition programme.</p>
<p>The company has put in an application to fly to Middle East and southeast Asian destinations.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
